        "TileImage": "$($repository bdc07512-8164-4d2c-9c20-1b54c00ae7ae).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rIt seems that members of the Ark Society care very highly of their positions, and are often in a discreet battle to keep their status and climb the ranks. How about we show them how a true master assassin can climb all the way to the top, and tear it down from within...\r\rGood luck.",
